        <h1 class="profile-detail-name">Guangzhou</h1>
        <div class="info-stats" style="margin-top:10px;">
          <div class="info-stat"><span class="info-stat-label">Period</span><span class="info-stat-val">214 BCE – present</span></div>
          <div class="info-stat"><span class="info-stat-label">Founded</span><span class="info-stat-val">Founded as Panyu on the eastern bank of the Pearl River in 214 BCE. A settlement now known as Nanwucheng was present in the area by 1100 BCE.</span></div>
          <div class="info-stat"><span class="info-stat-label">Where</span><span class="info-stat-val">On the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/pearl-river">Pearl River</a> in the delta of south-central <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/guangdong">Guangdong</a>, southern <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/china">China</a>, about 120 kilometres north-west of <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/hong-kong">Hong Kong</a> and 145 kilometres north of <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/macau">Macau</a>.</span></div>
